      "translation": "Arjuna said: Those who, endowed with faith, worship after setting aside the scriptural rule—what is their standing, O Kṛṣṇa? Is it sattva, rajas, or tamas? Śrīdhara takes the question to concern people who follow inherited custom with faith but, from discomfort or laziness, have not sought to understand the scriptural meaning.",
